        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, from high pressure network, at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, from high pressure network, at service station
The initial pressure of gas is from the high pressure network (1-5 bar). Air emissions are calculated from gas losses and composition of biogas.;
Synonyms: Kompogas, Naturgas; 
UUID: 0f45cbb8-2ced-38eb-81fc-645b1bb44bcf
This data set includes electricity requirements of a biogas service station as well as emissions from losses.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: Service station with high initial gas pressure (1-5 bar)
Time period: personal communication
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0f45cbb8-2ced-38eb-81fc-645b1bb44bcf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
